/-!
# Local normalizers in the exterior branch

The six-space normalizer factors through its original residual and centralizer.
The original residuals generate L, reducing both required containments to point
residual control and proving them in the equal-point-component branch.
The remaining source alternatives and all four native Janko actor rows
now prove both containments from the named maximal-two-local cover. The
full cover retains its independent producer; no local placement or marked
action premise remains in that conditional assembly.

Source: Aschbacher--Smith, 12.5.3--4, printed pp.817--819.
-/
